This directory is intended for project header files shared across every
PlatformIO environment in this firmware project.

PlatformIO automatically adds this directory to the global include path, so
any file placed here can be included from any source file as

    #include "road_east_version.h"

Keep cross-device, device-agnostic declarations here. Headers that belong to
a single device should live next to that device's sources under
src/<device_id>/.
